------------------------------------------
1- PROJECT MISSIONS
------------------------------------------
    - *Build  a lightweight, completely free tool to help self-learners* or people
who study under the Marugoto method to master Japanese (grammar structures,
verb conjugations, vocabulary, kanji and kana).
    - *Keep the experience free of ads, distractions and paywalls* that oftenly
difficult students' learning process
    - The project was created as a *review tool*, despite this, we encourage the
explanation inside the lessons to allow low-resources persons (who don't
have access to a japanese academy) to learn using the program
    - *International and language-friendly*, thanks to the structure, allowing 
everyone to upload the translation to other languages quickly

